 "remarks": "Welcome to Woodside Green, a three story pre-war building in a most convenient location. Walk to Scalzi Park, tennis courts, bus, shopping, downtown and Uconn. This 816 sq ft one bedroom unit was just freshly painted and ready for move in. Large foyer could be used as office space or small dining area. Light and bright sunny bedroom has great closet space. Hardwood flooring throughout. New Andersen windows were installed last year. Laundry room is located in the same building, no need to go outside. There is a move in and move out fee. No weekend moves allowed per condo rules. Good credit a must, pet considered. Hot water, cooking gas and parking included.",
